# {{ app_title }}

{{ description }}.

A FastAPI backend and a Svelte interface, built on
[jigkit](https://github.com/jmerhar/jigkit) for its foundations and
[devtools](https://github.com/jmerhar/devtools) for its build tooling, and shipped as one
container image.

## Running it

```bash
curl -O https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{{ github_owner }}/{{ app_slug }}/main/docker-compose.yml
docker compose up -d
```

Open http://127.0.0.1:8000 and make the first account. The settings are environment variables,
each explained in `docker-compose.yml`; the data lives in `./data`.

## Developing

```bash
make lockfile   # once, after the template is copied: frontend/package-lock.json
make install    # the backend's virtualenv and the frontend's packages
make openapi    # once, then after changing the API: the schema and the interface's types
make check      # lint, the API contract, both suites and their coverage gates
make dev        # the stack with hot reload: the API on :8000, the interface on :5173
```

`make help` lists the rest.

| Path | What it holds |
|---|---|
| `backend/src/{{ package }}/` | settings, models, the API's routes |
| `backend/alembic/` | migrations, run by the container before it serves |
| `backend/tests/` | pytest, against a throwaway database per test |
| `frontend/src/` | the interface: `App.svelte`, `pages/`, `lib/` |
| `frontend/messages/` | the interface's words, in English and European Portuguese |
| `frontend/icons/app-icon.svg` | the home-screen icon; `make app-icons` renders `frontend/public/icons/` |

